Frontend-
Develops the user interface of a website.	
Uses HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
Example: Amazon homepage.
Backend-
Handles server-side logic and databases.
Uses Java, PHP, Python, Node.js, etc.
Example: Login and payment processing.
FullStack-
Works on both frontend and backend.
Uses both frontend and backend technologies.
Example: Complete e-commerce website.
